      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Complex 1 is a zero-field Dy3 SMM. χmT at 300 K is 41.94 cm3 K mol−1 (theory 42.51 for three free Dy(III)); it falls slowly to 55 K then rapidly to 32.48 cm3 K mol−1 at 2 K. Magnetization at 2 K and 7 T reaches 30.18 Nβ. AC data under zero dc field show frequency- and temperature-dependent χ′ and χ″ with SMM peaks. Arrhenius fitting gave Ueff = 44.7 K and τ0 = 1.97 × 10−6 s; Orbach+Raman+QTM fitting gave Ueff = 60.53 K (C = 3.06, n = 2.50) and τ0 = 4.58 × 10−7 s. Hysteresis at 2 K is not obvious.",
